# Tests in this section have a parent AND instruction.
#
# Variations tested:
# - S_AND_B32 with live vs. dead SCC (implicit def liveness)
# - S_AND_B32 with different operand positions (imm in src0 vs src1)
# - V_AND_B32_e32, V_AND_B32_e64 in various parent/child combinations
# - Mixed scalar/vector: S_AND parent with V_AND child using materialized VGPR immediate
# - Non-contiguous masks (e.g., 0xf0f, 0x5ff) to verify bitwise subset checking
#
# Negative tests verify optimization does NOT occur when:
# - SCC implicit def is live
# - Child mask doesn't fully contain parent mask

---
